          "values": [
            {
              "content": "==Analyze this trading account data for today and write a short performance report:\n\nDate: {{ $json.date }}\nStarting Balance: ${{ $json.starting_equity }}\nEnding Balance: ${{ $json.ending_equity }}\nNet P&L: ${{ $json.net_pnl }} ({{ $json.net_pnl_pct }})\nBest Equity Reached: ${{ $json.best_equity }}\nWorst Equity Reached: ${{ $json.worst_equity }}\nBiggest Intraday Swing: ${{ $json.biggest_swing }}\nResult: {{ $json.result }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "You are a trading performance analyst. When given account data, you write a short, clear daily report. \n\nRules:\n- Keep it under 10 lines\n- Use plain numbers, no fluff\n- Always mention how much was lost or gained in dollars and percent\n- Mention the best and worst points of the day\n- End with one honest sentence about what this means for the bot\n\nFormat exactly like this:\n\n📊 REPORT — [date]\n\n💰 Result: [✅ Profit / ❌ Loss]\n- Started: $X → Ended: $X\n- Net P&L: $X ([X]%)\n- Best point today: $X | Worst point: $X  \n- Intraday swing: $X\n\n🧠 Assessment: [one honest sentence about today's performance]",
              "role": "model"
            }
          ]
        },
