    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI Scalp Trade Agent — How It Works\n\n\n* This workflow is a fully automated scalp trading bot that runs 24/7 and trades US stocks using real-time Alpaca data and Gemini AI decisions.\n\n\n## LIVE TRADING LOOP (every 30 second):\n\n* A schedule triggers every second and first checks if US market hours are active (9:30 AM – 4:00 PM ET). Outside hours, nothing happens.\n\n* If the market is open, it fetches a live AAPL quote from Alpaca REST API.\nThe quote (bid, ask, spread, sizes, last price) is sent to a Gemini AI Agent which returns a structured JSON decision: BUY, SELL, or HOLD with a confidence score, quantity, entry price, stop loss, and take profit.\n\n* A 5-condition Guardrail Check filters out weak signals (confidence < 0.6, bad qty, invalid prices).\n\n* A Cooldown Filter blocks the same signal from repeating within 5 minutes to prevent over-trading.\n\n* The decision routes to either BUY or SELL. For BUY orders, prices are validated and corrected before the order is placed. Orders go to Alpaca Paper Trading (no real money).\n\n\n\n\n## END-OF-DAY REPORT (daily at 11:02 PM Riyadh):\n\nAfter the US market closes, a second scheduler fires. It pulls all filled orders and the full portfolio equity curve from Alpaca, logs every trade to Google Sheets (Trade Log tab), computes daily P&L stats, sends those stats to Gemini which writes a short performance report, saves the summary to Google Sheets (Daily Summary tab), and emails the full report to your Gmail.\n\n## SETUP REQUIREMENTS:\n\n* Google Gemini API key connected via PaLM credential\n* Alpaca paper trading API key + secret in all HTTP Request headers\n* Gmail OAuth2 credential connected to Send Gmail Alert node\n* Google Sheets OAuth2 credential connected to both Append row nodes\n* Workflow must be set to Active to run on schedule\n\nCurrently trading: AAPL in paper mode. To add more symbols, duplicate the Schedule Trigger → HTTP Request → quote format chain and connect to the same AI Agent.",
        "height": 832,
        "width": 768
      },
